```
private static String detectFormat(byte[] header) {
    if (header[0] == (byte)0x89 && header[1] == 0x50 && header[2] == 0x4E && header[3] == 0x47) return "png";
    if (header[0] == 'G' && header[1] == 'I' && header[2] == 'F') return "gif";
    if (header[0] == (byte)0xFF && header[1] == (byte)0xD8 && header[2] == (byte)0xFF) return "jpeg";
    if (header[0] == 'R' && header[1] == 'I' && header[2] == 'F' && header[3] == 'F'
        && header[8] == 'W' && header[9] == 'E' && header[10] == 'B' && header[11] == 'P') return "webp";
    return null;
}
```
Need ensure header length at least 12. If read < 12, but for webp need 12. For others 8. If read < 8 return.

